24 (5.17 s) |\n| 9 s | 216 | 226 (9.42 s) |\n| 10 s | 240 | 226 (9.42 s) |\n| 12 s | 288 | 277 (11.54 s) |\n| 15 s | 360 | 379 (15.79 s) |"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":1636,"type":"CardamonJoinShotVideos","pos":[1890,4560],"size":[270,60],"flags":{},"order":39,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"videos","name":"videos","type":"VIDEO","link":3550},{"localized_name":"trim_frames","name":"trim_frames","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"trim_frames"},"link":3559}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[3551]}],"properties":{"aux_id":"cardamon/comfyui-cardamon-nodes","ver":"3ce58ee99f1c07ecea444bacd66327169a479e56","Node name for S&R":"CardamonJoinShotVideos"},"widgets_values":[22],"widgets_values_named":{"trim_frames":22}},{"id":1637,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[2180,4560],"size":[280,160],"flags":{},"order":40,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":3551},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"format.codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format.codec"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"encoding","name":"format.codec.encoding","shape":7,"type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format.codec.encoding"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"crf","name":"format.codec.encoding.crf","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"format.codec.encoding.crf"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","shape":7,"type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":[]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.34.0"},"widgets_values":["h3-t2v-joined","mp4","h264","re-encode",18,"auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"h3-t2v-joined","format":"mp4","format.codec":"h264","format.codec.encoding":"re-encode","format.codec.encoding.crf":18,"codec":"auto"}},{"id":1638,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-2890,5090],"size":[560,360],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[3562]}],"title":"Shot 2","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["The professor (S1) puts the rubber duck down on the bench next to its partner and picks up a flask of bright blue liquid in one hand and a beaker of clear liquid in the other. He says: <d>[English] Now, superposition. A particle can be in two states at once. Observe!</d> He pours the blue liquid into the clear beaker; with a soft fizz the mixture swirls and turns bright pink instead. He holds the beaker up to his glasses, squints at it, and says: <d>[English] Both blue and... pink. That was not in my notes.</d> He shrugs and sets the pink beaker on the bench. Static shot.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"The professor (S1) puts the rubber duck down on the bench next to its partner and picks up a flask of bright blue liquid in one hand and a beaker of clear liquid in the other. He says: <d>[English] Now, superposition. A particle can be in two states at once. Observe!</d> He pours the blue liquid into the clear beaker; with a soft fizz the mixture swirls and turns bright pink instead. He holds the beaker up to his glasses, squints at it, and says: <d>[English] Both blue and... pink. That was not in my notes.</d> He shrugs and sets the pink beaker on the bench. Static shot.\n"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":1639,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-2890,5490],"size":[560,360],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[3563]}],"title":"Shot 3","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["The professor (S1) slides a tall glass cylinder filled with liquid to the center of the bench and holds a small beaker of powder above it. He says: <d>[English] The act of observation collapses the wave function. So let us observe very, very closely.</d> He tips the powder into the cylinder and leans in with his face right above the opening; with a loud gurgling whoosh, a thick column of pink foam erupts upward past his face and spills over the bench, burying both rubber ducks. Foam drips from his glasses and mustache as he calmly says: <d>[English] Collapsed.</d> The camera pulls back with small amplitude at slow speed.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"The professor (S1) slides a tall glass cylinder filled with liquid to the center of the bench and holds a small beaker of powder above it. He says: <d>[English] The act of observation collapses the wave function. So let us observe very, very closely.</d> He tips the powder into the cylinder and leans in with his face right above the opening; with a loud gurgling whoosh, a thick column of pink foam erupts upward past his face and spills over the bench, burying both rubber ducks. Foam drips from his glasses and mustache as he calmly says: <d>[English] Collapsed.</d> The camera pulls back with small amplitude at slow speed.\n"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":1640,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-2890,5890],"size":[560,360],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[3564]}],"title":"Shot 4","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["The professor (S1) stands behind the foam-covered bench, pink foam dripping from his glasses, mustache and lab coat. He wipes his glasses on his sleeve, puts them back on, and turns a knob on the Bunsen burner, which lights with a soft pop. He says: <d>[English] Energy levels! Add energy, and the electrons jump up to a higher state.</d> He opens the gas knob wider; the flame roars up with a loud whoosh, and a puff of smoke rises from his wild white hair, which is now slightly singed and smoking at the tips. He pats his head and says: <d>[English] Much like my eyebrows just did.</d> Static shot.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"The professor (S1) stands behind the foam-covered bench, pink foam dripping from his glasses, mustache and lab coat. He wipes his glasses on his sleeve, puts them back on, and turns a knob on the Bunsen burner, which lights with a soft pop. He says: <d>[English] Energy levels! Add energy, and the electrons jump up to a higher state.</d> He opens the gas knob wider; the flame roars up with a loud whoosh, and a puff of smoke rises from his wild white hair, which is now slightly singed and smoking at the tips. He pats his head and says: <d>[English] Much like my eyebrows just did.</d> Static shot.\n"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":1641,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-2890,6290],"size":[560,360],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[3565]}],"title":"Shot 5","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["The professor (S1) stands behind the bench with smoke curling gently from his singed white hair, soot smudged across his cheeks, and pink foam still dripping from the bench and his lab coat. One rubber duck bobs up out of the foam in front of him. He straightens his red bow tie with dignity and says: <d>[English] And that, class, is quantum entanglement. Any questions?</d> He leans on the bench and presses his hand on the foam, squeezing the hidden second duck, which lets out a squeak; at the same moment the visible duck also squeaks. His eyes widen behind his glasses, and he raises both fists in triumph and says: <d>[English] Entangled!</d> The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward his delighted face.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"The professor (S1) stands behind the bench with smoke curling gently from his singed white hair, soot smudged across his cheeks, and pink foam still dripping from the bench and his lab coat. One rubber duck bobs up out of the foam in front of him. He straightens his red bow tie with dignity and says: <d>[English] And that, class, is quantum entanglement. Any questions?</d> He leans on the bench and presses his hand on the foam, squeezing the hidden second duck, which lets out a squeak; at the same moment the visible duck also squeaks. His eyes widen behind his glasses, and he raises both fists in triumph and says: <d>[English] Entangled!</d> The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward his delighted face.\n"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":1642,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-3160,4240],"size":[830,410],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[3566]}],"title":"Shot template","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["integrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, comedic tone. A medium shot frames a cluttered university chemistry lab: a long wooden bench crowded with glass flasks, beakers, test tubes and a Bunsen burner, and behind it a chalkboard covered in scribbled equations and a crude drawing of two atoms connected by a wavy line. The professor (S1) is an eccentric man in his sixties with wild white hair, round wire-rimmed glasses, a bushy grey mustache, a red bow tie, and a white lab coat over a brown tweed vest; he speaks in a warm, slightly raspy British voice with theatrical enthusiasm. {{ SHOT }}\n\noverall_soundscape: The steady hum of lab ventilation and the soft bubbling of glassware fill the room, with occasional clinks of glass and the professor's shoes squeaking on the tiled floor.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Playful, bouncy comedic orchestral music with plucked pizzicato strings and a mischievous bassoon melody.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"integrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, comedic tone. A medium shot frames a cluttered university chemistry lab: a long wooden bench crowded with glass flasks, beakers, test tubes and a Bunsen burner, and behind it a chalkboard covered in scribbled equations and a crude drawing of two atoms connected by a wavy line. The professor (S1) is an eccentric man in his sixties with wild white hair, round wire-rimmed glasses, a bushy grey mustache, a red bow tie, and a white lab coat over a brown tweed vest; he speaks in a warm, slightly raspy British voice with theatrical enthusiasm. {{ SHOT }}\n\noverall_soundscape: The steady hum of lab ventilation and the soft bubbling of glassware fill the room, with occasional clinks of glass and the professor's shoes squeaking on the tiled floor.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Playful, bouncy comedic orchestral music with plucked pizzicato strings and a mischievous bassoon melody.\n"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":1643,"type":"Note","pos":[-1670,3870],"size":[600,120],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["There are many distillation LoRAs, and new ones pop up every now and then. Currently, many can be found here: https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/tree/mai